        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. Your targets are Nicholas Velmorres, a drug dealer with violent tendencies, and his hired help: Dennis Elliot, Alex Moyer, and Sixto Perez.  Our client wants them dead to avenge their younger brother, who disappeared under mysterious circumstances during an investigation on Velmorres. Good luck. I will leave you to prepare.",
